If Tip Wallet is already installed, update over it — don’t uninstall first, or you can lose the wallet on that phone.
## What Tip is for
- Scan / paste PulseChain payment QRs (EIP-681)
- Send and receive on PulseChain
- PulseX swap (Tip fee **0%**)
- Seed phrase and private key backup
## Not included (on purpose)
- Hardware wallets
- Website connect / WalletConnect
- Multi-chain portfolio clouds from other wallets
## Safety
- Tip is **self-custody**. Your seed stays on your device.
- Never share your seed phrase or private key.
- Double-check the **address**, **coin**, **amount**, and **PulseChain** before you confirm a send.
- On-chain sends can’t be undone.
## Network
- **PulseChain** (chain id `369`)
- Optional Testnet V4 (`943`) in Settings
## Notes
- This release is a **sideload** Android build for trying Tip, not a Google Play listing.
- English UI only for now.
## License / lineage
Tip Wallet is a PulseChain-first product built from a fork of Rabby Mobile (lineage, not identity).
